NVIDIA NV_fragment_program reference
------------------------------------
Fragment shader assembler is an implementation based on publicly documented 
NVIDIA NV_fragment_program OpenGL extensions and the Nouveau project's 
the open-source Mesa/nouveau drivers. No NVIDIA proprietary source code is used. 
This comes from PSL1GHT in the form of cgcomp and is planned for deprecation 
and removal once a replacement is ready.

IBM Cell Broadband Engine intrinsics and manuals
------------------------------------------------
SPU intrinsic names, ABI, and instruction encodings are based on the public
IBM Cell Broadband Engine Architecture specification and the STI Consortium
SPU C/C++ Language Extensions Specification. These are publicly published
documents; no proprietary IBM source is used.

PSDevWiki
---------
Community-maintained PS3 documentation at https://www.psdevwiki.com provided
the NID/FNID algorithm and LV2 syscall numbering referenced by this project's
tooling.

